.TH "GF-FOLDERS-UPDATE-FOLDER-PERMISSIONS" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-folders-update-folder-permissions - Updates permissions for a folder this operation will remove existing permissions if they re not included in the request


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf folders update-folder-permissions [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates permissions for a folder this operation will remove existing permissions if they re not included in the request

.PP
Body schema (UpdateDashboardACLCommand):
{
  "items": [
    {
      "permission": number,
      "role": string,
      "teamId": number,
      "userId": number
    }
  ]
}
  items[].role             enum: None | Viewer | Editor | Admin


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--body\fP=""
	Request body JSON or path to a JSON file (e.g. --body=/path/to/body.json, --body='{"foo": "bar"}'). The 'Body schema' block is a type reference; use --describe-body-jsonschema for a strict JSON Schema.

